  "body": "**What.** Read the cavity sources #198 could not open, Ismail et al., Opt. Express 24, 16366 (2016), whose Optica page returned a loading screen: Ikeda 1979, Felber and Marburger 1978, Coen and Haelterman 1997, and Lugiato and Lefever 1987. Also reach Google Scholar's cited-by list for Fratini et al. 2014. Record them in notes/LIT_REVIEW.md's ledgers. Recommended by #198's subagent.\n\n**Why.** #198's verdicts (analogy only for the linear and nonlinear cavity, nothing found in Fratini et al.'s follow-ups) rest partly on records of these sources, not their text.\n\n**Acceptance (can fail).** Each source read in full and recorded, with what it does and does not contain. #198's verdicts restated, or changed if any source holds a tool they miss. No novelty sentence.\n\n**Depends on.** #198.\n",
